  << /ActualText (Scene\072 House Exterior\n\n\052grey\054 mid to late day\056 the hero finds her neighbour waiting on the porch\052\050\nplayer clicks on Erma to start dialogue \n\050Neigbour\050Erma\077\051\072 \034Well\054 look who finally decided to come outside\056\035\n\nNeigbour\050Erma\077\051\072 \034well\056\056\077 aren\031t you gonna say anything\077\035\n\nHero\072 \034You\031re not dinner\056\056\056\035\n\nNeigbour\050Erma\077\051\072 \077\077\077\n\nNeigbour\050Erma\077\051\072 \034You\031ve really let this place go\056 You know\054 we all have responsibilities to uphold\054 even if we don\031t feel like it\056 Everyone in town is doing their best\054 you could put in more effort to help\056\035\n\nNeigbour\050Erma\077\051\072 \034Are you going to do anything about that mailbox of yours\077\035\n\nHero\072 \056\056\056\n\n\034Your yards a bit of an eyesore\056\035\n\nNeigbour\050Erma\077\051\072 \034Veronica has been asking about you\054 maybe you should talk to her while you\031re up\056\035\n\nNeigbour\050Erma\077\051\072 \034Anyway\054 nice to see you up and about\056\056\056\035\n\n)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 236 0 R
     /Pg 232 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
